OL,3,GNEWSASchoolgirl's takes bee-saving
OL,4,Acampaign to Parliament
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn eight-year-old girl's campaign to
OL,7,Fsave Britain's bees has got to
OL,8,FParliament after she created a petition
OL,9,Fat her primary school.
OL,11,FElouisa's petition attracted about 40
OL,12,Fsignatures from her friends and
OL,13,Fteachers in Skerton in Lancashire.
OL,15,FElouisa met Cat Smith, the Lancaster
OL,16,Fand Wyre MP, to talk about why
OL,17,Fprotecting bees matters so much to her
OL,18,Fand handed over her petition to be
OL,19,Ftaken to Westminster.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
